WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.698
Punch him right in his face.

00:00:01.698 --> 00:00:04.101
Hello.

00:00:04.101 --> 00:00:08.565
Hey, hi there, can you let me in?

00:00:08.565 --> 00:00:10.930
How bout you let me in.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.150
Please, I won't hurt you.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.340
Maybe I am turning into the monster here.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.420
Why do I always ruin everything?

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.423
I just want this to be a nice, normal
operation with.

00:00:24.626 --> 00:00:26.910
Kill it with fire.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.214
&gt;&gt; All right you bastard kiddies.

00:00:28.214 --> 00:00:30.292
I've had it up to here with you guys.

00:00:30.292 --> 00:00:31.384
[NOISE]

00:00:31.384 --> 00:00:32.890
&gt;&gt; Oooh.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:33.570
Hi.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.540
I'm an SCP now.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:36.285
S-C-P.

00:00:36.285 --> 00:00:40.044
M-A-R-K-I-P-L-I-E-R.

00:00:40.044 --> 00:00:44.503
The most lethal SCP around.

00:00:44.503 --> 00:00:47.301
[SOUND].

00:00:47.301 --> 00:00:50.791
[SOUND].

00:00:50.791 --> 00:00:54.495
I'm not actually lethal, I just like to
pop out of walls and go [SOUND].

00:00:54.495 --> 00:00:56.383
Ah!

00:00:56.383 --> 00:00:59.255
I almost walked right into that.

00:00:59.255 --> 00:01:02.740
[SOUND].

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:07.560
Well, I'm just the biggest idiot that ever
existed in the entire world.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.390
I'm so stupid.

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:11.958
I never even bothered to try and jump.

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:14.420
What kind of moron am I?

00:01:19.251 --> 00:01:24.127
To my one million fans, thank you.

00:01:24.127 --> 00:01:30.547
[CROSSTALK]

00:01:30.547 --> 00:01:33.798
&gt;&gt; Until you detect something moving in
front of the light.

00:01:33.798 --> 00:01:37.803
Casting a shadow over you, you blink.

00:01:37.803 --> 00:01:38.860
Beginning to turn.

